      "content": "these are okay, but the scores are actually coming in a bit lower than I expected. i think the classifier might be missing the nuance because the reviews are a little too \"balanced\" or subtle. \n\ncan you try another set of 5? i really need the positivity index to be much higher to test the upper limits of the engine's detection range. just try to make them even more overwhelmingly positive. again, try to keep them sounding like real people, but definitely lean harder into the luxury/high-end praise so we get those high scores. i'll let you know if it starts looking like keyword stuffing, just try to get the score up.",
